Package: zr
Title: Zarr V2/V3 Arrays via the 'zarrs' Rust Crate
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Michael D.", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read and write Zarr V2 and V3 multidimensional arrays using the
    'zarrs' Rust library. Provides low-level access to stores, groups, arrays,
    chunks, and metadata with minimal overhead. Designed as a composable
    building block for higher-level array packages.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/hypertidy/zr
BugReports: https://github.com/hypertidy/zr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.82.0
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
